s=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">## Description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">The proof is written, but the separate lemma on which it depends still contains sorry.</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">namespace</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fixture2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">/-- **Theorem 3** (Fixture2000). Apply Lemma 1 and remove the final addition of zero. -/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">theorem</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> degree_le_mul_one_add_zero</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (c : ChainComplexToy) : c.degree ≤ c.degree * </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> + </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> := </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">by</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  simpa only [Nat.add_zero] </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">using</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> degree_le_mul_one c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">end</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Fixture2000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span></code></pre>",
    "source_text": "import HomAlg.Fixture2000.Def_1\nimport HomAlg.Fixture2000.Lem_1\n\n/-!\n```yaml node\n{\n  \"id\": \"Fixture2000.Thm_3\",\n  \"kind\": \"theorem\",\n  \"doc\": \"Fixture2000\",\n  \"source\": {\n    \"chapter\": \"1\",\n    \"section\": \"1.1\",\n    \"label\": \"Theorem 3\",\n    \"pages\": [\n      3\n    ]\n  },\n  \"title\": \"Theorem 3\",\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"chain-complex\",\n    \"basic\"\n  ],\n  \"concepts\": {\n    \"defines\": [],\n    \"uses\": []\n  },\n  \"deps\": {\n    \"statement\": [\n      \"Fixture2000.Def_1\"\n    ],\n    \"proof\": [\n      \"Fixture2000.Lem_1\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"decls\": [\n    \"Fixture2000.degree_le_mul_one_add_zero\"\n  ],\n  \"fidelity\": {\n    \"status\": \"faithful\"\n  },\n  \"nl_proof_source\": {\n    \"follows\": \"document\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Statement\n\nFor every toy chain complex $C$, $\\deg C \\leq (\\deg C)\\cdot 1+0$.\n\n## Proof\n\nApply Lemma 1, then use that adding zero leaves its right side unchanged. [uses `Fixture2000.Lem_1`]\n\n## Description\n\nThe proof is written, but the separate lemma on which it depends still contains sorry.\n-/\n\nnamespace Fixture2000\n\n/-- **Theorem 3** (Fixture2000). Apply Lemma 1 and remove the final addition of zero. -/\ntheorem degree_le_mul_one_add_zero (c : ChainComplexToy) : c.degree ≤ c.degree * 1 + 0 := by\n  simpa only [Nat.add_zero] using degree_le_mul_one c\n\nend Fixture2000\n"
